    "name": "Engraving",
    "steam_appid": 2616650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/afdfe03052c5dd92ff6a71f609d3790d.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engraving</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror adventure set in a foreboding forest that reshapes itself each time you close your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map your surroundings by hand</strong>, discover new <strong>methods of traversal</strong>, and solve <strong>ritualistic puzzles</strong> in an ever-shifting landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you pick up the quill and dare to look into an abyss beyond mortal comprehension?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THICK ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engraving takes place in a forest that you can freely explore in a non-linear way. Every puzzle you solve and every mystery you uncover will open up new areas and layers of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone... something ancient and unspeakable is tracking your every step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/4badb2163f88246437dc6ae70ee9d8fb.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/4badb2163f88246437dc6ae70ee9d8fb.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/4badb2163f88246437dc6ae70ee9d8fb.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAPPING REDEFINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only map you get is the one you <strong>draw yourself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take notes. Mark locations. Track your path by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no quest markers. No hand-holding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your initiative is your only guide. Without it, your soul is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/be352abe8420adb7fe87bee3f2a6f0e0.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/be352abe8420adb7fe87bee3f2a6f0e0.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/be352abe8420adb7fe87bee3f2a6f0e0.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURSED AND FORGOTTEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came here a graverobber, chasing relics. Now the forest has turned against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping curse eats away at your mind and body. Each step exhausts you - but rest comes at a terrible price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in a forest that has shifted. If you wake up at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/f432c52ce491fe9385b2a3bff1138029.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/f432c52ce491fe9385b2a3bff1138029.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/f432c52ce491fe9385b2a3bff1138029.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO NOT DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death hides in the shadows in many forms. But it offers no respite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not make the mistake of thinking the afterlife is an escape from this curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/344d00bd41e4cbc47fad2f84be07a08a.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/344d00bd41e4cbc47fad2f84be07a08a.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/344d00bd41e4cbc47fad2f84be07a08a.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/afdfe03052c5dd92ff6a71f609d3790d.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=151 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engraving</strong> is an atmospheric first-person horror adventure set in a foreboding forest that reshapes itself each time you close your eyes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map your surroundings by hand</strong>, discover new <strong>methods of traversal</strong>, and solve <strong>ritualistic puzzles</strong> in an ever-shifting landscape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you pick up the quill and dare to look into an abyss beyond mortal comprehension?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THICK ATMOSPHERE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engraving takes place in a forest that you can freely explore in a non-linear way. Every puzzle you solve and every mystery you uncover will open up new areas and layers of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not alone... something ancient and unspeakable is tracking your every step!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/4badb2163f88246437dc6ae70ee9d8fb.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/4badb2163f88246437dc6ae70ee9d8fb.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/4badb2163f88246437dc6ae70ee9d8fb.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MAPPING REDEFINED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only map you get is the one you <strong>draw yourself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take notes. Mark locations. Track your path by hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are no quest markers. No hand-holding.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your initiative is your only guide. Without it, your soul is lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/be352abe8420adb7fe87bee3f2a6f0e0.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/be352abe8420adb7fe87bee3f2a6f0e0.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/be352abe8420adb7fe87bee3f2a6f0e0.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CURSED AND FORGOTTEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You came here a graverobber, chasing relics. Now the forest has turned against you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping curse eats away at your mind and body. Each step exhausts you - but rest comes at a terrible price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up in a forest that has shifted. If you wake up at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/f432c52ce491fe9385b2a3bff1138029.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/f432c52ce491fe9385b2a3bff1138029.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/f432c52ce491fe9385b2a3bff1138029.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DO NOT DIE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death hides in the shadows in many forms. But it offers no respite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not make the mistake of thinking the afterlife is an escape from this curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It will cost you dearly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/344d00bd41e4cbc47fad2f84be07a08a.poster.avif?t=1753472208\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/344d00bd41e4cbc47fad2f84be07a08a.webm?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2616650/extras/344d00bd41e4cbc47fad2f84be07a08a.mp4?t=1753472208\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
